Primary workflow principles
•	Search, eligibility and calculation are distinct states: selecting an account is not the same as authorizing settlement.
•	Maturity closure and premature closure can use different rules, controls and reason requirements.
•	Maker and checker actions must be distinct according to role permissions.
•	“Settled” must only appear after the required financial posting and payment outcome are confirmed.
