B. Deposit information — read-only
Display scheme name, account number, principal, applicable rate, opening date, maturity date, original term, interest payout frequency and any liens, holds, linked loans or pending claims. Values should be fetched from authoritative account data.
3.1 Settlement request, calculation and payout
C. Settlement request — editable inputs
Field	Control	Logic / validation
Settlement type *	Select	Maturity Settlement; Premature Closure; Deceased Claim only if dedicated flow is enabled.
Settlement date *	Date picker	Validate against business date, permissible effective dates and quote validity.
Reason *	Select	Required when policy demands; options may include Customer Request / Financial Requirement / Other.
Remarks	Textarea	Capture meaningful explanation; mandatory for exceptions or rejection resubmissions if configured.
