D. Settlement calculation — backend-issued, read-only
Line item	Example value	Display note
Principal amount	INR 1,00,000.00	Original outstanding principal (scheme rules apply).
Interest payable	+ INR 12,000.00	May include interest earned or unpaid within configured policy.
Overdue interest	+ INR 0.00	Show only if applicable.
Interest recovery	- INR 500.00	Recover excess / previously credited amount if required.
Premature penalty	- INR 1,000.00	Calculated by authoritative backend rules.
TDS / tax	- INR 0.00	Display server-provided tax; no client-side tax engine.
Other deductions	- INR 0.00	Itemize offsets, fees or recoveries when relevant.
NET PAYABLE	INR 1,10,500.00	Emphasize; read-only and version-bound.

Calculation availability is not settlement approval. Quote results must carry quote ID, expiry, source version and blocking warnings. The browser must not locally recalculate payout amounts.
E. Payment and transfer
Field	Control / requirements
Payment mode *	Select from server-allowed methods: linked savings transfer; NEFT/RTGS; cheque; cash only if permitted.
Beneficiary account *	Select approved linked account or capture external beneficiary details via separate validated flow.
