Scheme policy must not be assumed
“MIS” can denote different products in different institutions. Do not assume all MIS schemes use government Post Office MIS rules or that all FD products have identical premature-closure rules. Display closure eligibility, deductions and permitted payment modes from the configured product and authoritative server checks.
