Implementation boundary
This document is a proposed frontend implementation specification, not a legal interpretation of any deposit scheme. Settlement eligibility, interest, penalties, tax, recoveries, posting, receipts and approval permissions must be sourced from and validated by the existing backend and approved institution policies.
Handoff note
Recommended implementation: create a single TermDepositSettlementPage and reusable cards and dialogs, while keeping all financial calculation and business-policy logic server-side. Confirm existing API endpoints, scheme metadata, user roles and transaction state definitions before connecting production operations.
